      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0100_D32_00039",
      "en_US": [
        "A Trainer who just caught a Pokémon.\n",
        "That’s what this statue represents."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0100_D32_00040",
      "en_US": [
        "“Boastful of Capture”...\n",
        "That seems to be the title."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0100_D32_00041",
      "en_US": [
